config.command:
Generiere Landing-Page-Copy für die App {{ slug }}.

SPEC-AUSZUG:
- Name: {{ name }}
- Type: {{ spec_type }}
- Target Users: {{ target_users }}
- Brand Tone: {{ brand_tone }}
- Primary Color: {{ brand_primary_color }}
- Features (Phase 1): {{ feature_order_json }}

Gib JSON aus mit Struktur:
{
  "hero": {"headline": "...", "subheadline": "..."},
  "features": [{"title": "...", "description": "...", "benefit": "..."}, ...],
  "cta": {"primary": "...", "micro": "..."},
  "meta": {"title": "...", "description": "...", "og_title": "...", "og_description": "..."},
  "og_image_prompt": "..."
}

Matcht den Brand-Tone exakt. Spricht den target_users persona direkt an, NICHT 'everyone'.
